                          "Citation": "Pålsson E, Fejgin K, Wass C, Engel JA, Svensson L, Klamer D. The amino acid L-lysine blocks the disruptive effect of phencyclidine on prepulse inhibition in mice. Psychopharmacology (Berl). 2007 May;192(1):9–15. doi: 10.1007/s00213-006-0683-x. PMID: 17235609.",
